Hi all,

I've been playing NetHack for a little over a year now, and I've
finally managed to pull off my first ascension.

The beginning of the game was pretty unremarkable: My pet dog died on
dlvl 2, I got a bones file in the mines that yielded a magic marker,
and I used a smoky potion wish to get a cloak of magic resistance, but
it was fairly standard stuff apart from that.  Shortly after I wished
for the CoMR, I got zapped by a troll with a wand of death, so I guess
it was a good choice ;).

I got Cleaver from sacrificing early on, and used that for most of the
game, swapping for twoweaponing Stormbringer and a Silver Saber once I
was able to obtain the former from a wish (I was never crowned).
Besides the early smoky potion wish, I got another wish from a magic
lamp, used the wand in the castle, and found another wand in Gehennom.
I also found no less than three amulets of life saving in Gehennom (not
counting the one in Vlad's tower).  I also wasn't paying attention at
one point in Gehennom and got hit with a cockatrice's hiss without
realizing it.  Would've been YASD if I hadn't been wearing an "oLS.

The ascension run went fairly well, apart from the astral plain.
There, I managed to get my HP absolutely ravaged by Death.  In
addition, my bloodthirsty Stormbringer attacked the high priest of Crom
at one point while I was stunned.  But, despite this, I found the altar
of Set in the second temple I visited, and #offered the amulet...

